        {
          "text": "Flexi-access drawdown provides tax-efficient means of drawing benefits from pension fund with tax-free lump sum of up to 25% (subject to Lump Sum Allowance of \u00A3268,275) and remaining fund accessed as income taxed at marginal rate",
